{"page":407,"verses":[{"verse_key":"30:25","surah":30,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ أَن تَقُومَ ٱلسَّمَآءُ وَٱلْأَرْضُ بِأَمْرِهِۦ ۚ ثُمَّ إِذَا دَعَاكُمْ دَعْوَةً مِّنَ ٱلْأَرْضِ إِذَآ أَنتُمْ تَخْرُجُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Among His signs, too, is the fact that the heavens and the earth stand firm by His command. In the end, you will all emerge when He calls you from the earth.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"And among","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"(is) that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَقُومَ","en_gloss":"stands","transliteration":"taqūma","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāu","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضُ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍu","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"by His Command","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"دَعَاكُمْ","en_gloss":"He calls you","transliteration":"daʿākum","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دَعْوَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(with) a call","transliteration":"daʿwatan","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِذَآ","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"You","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَخْرُجُونَ","en_gloss":"will come forth","transliteration":"takhrujūna","verse_key":"30:25"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:25"}]},{"verse_key":"30:26","surah":30,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَهُۥ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ كُلٌّ لَّهُۥ قَـٰنِتُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everyone in the heavens and earth belongs to Him, and all are obedient to Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"And to Him (belongs)","transliteration":"walahu","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كُلٌّۭ","en_gloss":"All","transliteration":"kullun","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَـٰنِتُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) obedient","transliteration":"qānitūna","verse_key":"30:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:26"}]},{"verse_key":"30:27","surah":30,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى يَبْدَؤُا۟ ٱلْخَلْقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ وَهُوَ أَهْوَنُ عَلَيْهِ ۚ وَلَهُ ٱلْمَثَلُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He is the One who originates creation and will do it again- this is even easier for Him. He is above all comparison in the heavens and earth; He is the Almighty, the All Wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"originates","transliteration":"yabda-u","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْخَلْقَ","en_gloss":"the creation","transliteration":"l-khalqa","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُعِيدُهُۥ","en_gloss":"repeats it","transliteration":"yuʿīduhu","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and it","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَهْوَنُ","en_gloss":"(is) easier","transliteration":"ahwanu","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"for Him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَهُ","en_gloss":"And for Him","transliteration":"walahu","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمَثَلُ","en_gloss":"(is) the description","transliteration":"l-mathalu","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","en_gloss":"the highest","transliteration":"l-aʿlā","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","verse_key":"30:27"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:27"}]},{"verse_key":"30:28","surah":30,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"ضَرَبَ لَكُم مَّثَلًا مِّنْ أَنفُسِكُمْ ۖ هَل لَّكُم مِّن مَّا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُكُم مِّن شُرَكَآءَ فِى مَا رَزَقْنَـٰكُمْ فَأَنتُمْ فِيهِ سَوَآءٌ تَخَافُونَهُمْ كَخِيفَتِكُمْ أَنفُسَكُمْ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نُفَصِّلُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لِقَوْمٍ يَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He gives you this example, drawn from your own lives: do you make your slaves full partners with an equal share in what We have given you? Do you fear them as you fear each other? This is how We make Our messages clear to those who use their reason.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ضَرَبَ","en_gloss":"He sets forth","transliteration":"ḍaraba","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّثَلًۭا","en_gloss":"an example","transliteration":"mathalan","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusikum","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هَل","en_gloss":"Is","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَلَكَتْ","en_gloss":"possess","transliteration":"malakat","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنُكُم","en_gloss":"your right hands","transliteration":"aymānukum","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"شُرَكَآءَ","en_gloss":"partners","transliteration":"shurakāa","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":16,"ar":"رَزَقْنَـٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"We have provided you","transliteration":"razaqnākum","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"so you","transliteration":"fa-antum","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":19,"ar":"سَوَآءٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) equal","transliteration":"sawāon","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":20,"ar":"تَخَافُونَهُمْ","en_gloss":"you fear them","transliteration":"takhāfūnahum","verse_key":"30:28"},{"pos":21,"ar":"كَخِيفَتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"as you fear","